    },
    "Happenings fill up to %lld of the day's %lld colors — the largest share, because they are the part of the day you choose. Each happening counts once per day." : {
      "comment" : "MetricOverlay – how happenings contribute",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Happenings fill up to %1$lld of the day's %2$lld colors — the largest share, because they are the part of the day you choose. Each happening counts once per day."
